{"unit_id":"coolchengSAMA__dsh-token-combo#readme-5","repo":"coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo","commit":"3f7e98864a69687344c129db828b2a3d0886bfd8","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@local/dsh-token-combo README · 功能：- **实时连击**：每段可见 Token 命中 +1，按字符估算词元数，累计分数\n- **等级与倍率**：连击槽攒满升阶，空闲会回退/掉级，最低级才会断连\n- **七位角色**：DeepSeek / ChatGPT / Claude / Gemini / GLM / Grok / Qwen\n- **三个显示位置**，各自独立开关：\n  - 窗口悬浮窗\n  - 聊天栏紧凑徽章\n  - 桌面透明悬浮窗\n- **桌面悬浮窗**：置顶、透明、可拖动、悬停/拖动虚线、位置记忆、鼠标穿透\n- **多智能体汇总**：同一对话里的 subagent / teammate 共享一条连击\n- 音效、低动态、试炼预览、内容对齐、80%–240% 缩放","source":"extracted","section":"功能"}
{"unit_id":"coolchengSAMA__dsh-token-combo#readme-6","repo":"coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo","commit":"3f7e98864a69687344c129db828b2a3d0886bfd8","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@local/dsh-token-combo README · 环境：- Windows 10 / 11（x64）\n- DeepSeek Harness Desktop\n- 桌面悬浮窗需要 WebView2 Runtime（Windows 11 通常自带）","source":"extracted","section":"环境"}
{"unit_id":"coolchengSAMA__dsh-token-combo#readme-7","repo":"coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo","commit":"3f7e98864a69687344c129db828b2a3d0886bfd8","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@local/dsh-token-combo README · 安装：1. 下载或克隆本仓库到本地目录\n2. 在 DeepSeek Harness 中安装本地插件包，target 指向本仓库目录：\n\n```text\n   plugin_manager install_bundle\n     target: <本仓库路径>\n   ```\n\n3. 重启 DSH，从侧边栏打开「词元连击」","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"coolchengSAMA__dsh-token-combo#readme-8","repo":"coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo","commit":"3f7e98864a69687344c129db828b2a3d0886bfd8","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@local/dsh-token-combo README · 使用：- 在控制台里分别开关窗口悬浮窗、聊天栏和桌面悬浮窗\n- 桌面悬浮窗默认 `Ctrl+Alt+T` 切换鼠标穿透，`Ctrl+Alt+X` 关闭\n- 双击窗口悬浮窗可收起为小徽章，点击徽章展开\n- 偏好和悬浮窗位置保存在浏览器本地","source":"extracted","section":"使用"}
